### Agent room: private room with the voice assistant
# {{token}} is a Sanctum bearer token (POST /api/auth/login returns one).
POST {{host}}/api/voice/token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "kind": "agent"
}

### Call room: shared with another user (peerUserId is the bigint users.id)
POST {{host}}/api/voice/token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "kind": "call",
  "peerUserId": 2
}
